{
  "slug": "supericons",
  "name": "Supericons",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Supericons helps AI agents search, recommend, and retrieve SVG icons through MCP. It gives coding agents access to semantic icon search across 20,000+ free icons, so they can find icons by meaning, UI purpose, library, style, and product context without leaving the IDE/CLI.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `supericons-icon-search` (Use Supericons MCP when the user needs to find, preview, compare, retrieve, or recommend SVG icons for software…) and **1 MCP server**, `supericons`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install supericons@claude-community` from `curlymolelabs/supericons`.",
